  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "二十四小时待命安排  (Isolating the Star With VIP Hotel Rules)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Putting on his warmest smile at a five-star suite, Kaiwen flatters the replacement idol with round-the-clock VIP treatment so the singer willingly sends all of his own agency staff home. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这家酒店是我们老大的甄选，重新给您布置过了，您将就一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其他的艺人都是统一住，但是老大交代过您是单独安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们制片部门的人员性子比较直，老大让您别往心里去，别误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "打了人说误会？你们得负法律责任！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们魅力远航的周期实在是太紧了，下个礼拜就要去外景地拍摄了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这个礼拜我们就在国内把培训完成，明天开始摄像师就得跟拍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "根据节目的规则，您所有的生活起居都得由我们导演组来对接。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们已经安排好了助理、营养师还有专业的安保，在隔壁房间二十四小时待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以您带来的这些工作人员就可以先回去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不行，我们必须陪着贾先生！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那您就好好休息吧，我先走了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这家酒店是我们老大的甄选，重新给您布置过了，您将就一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our boss handpicked this hotel and had the suite redecorated—please make yourself at home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其他的艺人都是统一住，但是老大交代过您是单独安排。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All the other artists stay together, yet our boss gave special instructions to house you separately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们制片部门的人员性子比较直，老大让您别往心里去，别误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our production crew can be blunt; the boss hopes you will not take it to heart or misunderstand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "打了人说误会？你们得负法律责任！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Calling a brawl a misunderstanding? You people ought to face legal liability!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们魅力远航的周期实在是太紧了，下个礼拜就要去外景地拍摄了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our schedule on Charming Voyage is super tight—next week we fly out to shoot on location.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这个礼拜我们就在国内把培训完成，明天开始摄像师就得跟拍。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This week we finish training at home, and starting tomorrow camera operators follow you nonstop.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "根据节目的规则，您所有的生活起居都得由我们导演组来对接。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Under show rules, every detail of your daily routine must be handled directly by our directing team.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们已经安排好了助理、营养师还有专业的安保，在隔壁房间二十四小时待命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have assigned assistants, a nutritionist, and security standing by twenty-four hours next door.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以您带来的这些工作人员就可以先回去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So all the handlers you brought from your agency may head on back now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "不行，我们必须陪着贾先生！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Out of the question—we must stay right beside Mr Jia!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那您就好好休息吧，我先走了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since Mr Jia agrees to our professional setup, rest well—I will take my leave!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
